# HephaestusBridge

- Sync edits to both the **live** UE project plugin and `hephaestus_forge/templates/ue_plugin/HephaestusBridge/`.
- `RouteCommand`: resolve params with `TryGetObjectField("params")` then `"args"` — never `GetObjectField` (empty object swallows args).
- `SpawnStaticMeshActor`: Movable mobility before `SetStaticMesh`; fail loudly if mesh load fails.
- Vision: force pixel alpha 255 after `ReadPixels`; do not vertical-flip GameViewport captures on UE 5.8.
- Rebuild requires closing Live Coding / editor lock; then retest PIE `:8765`.
